WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
[Animated photograph] A colourful sailing pirogue glides across Lake Nokoué, near Ganvié in Benin.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:15.000
[Filmed aerial view] The historic city of Ouidah, its streets, vegetation and everyday life.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.000
[Animated photograph] A woman in a pirogue, surrounded by the vegetation of Lake Nokoué. The journey takes its time.
